cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >
  If you use this software in your research, please cite it using the metadata below.
title: "Wolken-Modul: interactive Grundner et al. 2024 cloud-cover diagnostic"
abstract: >
  Interactive live diagnosis of the Grundner et al. (2024, JAMES) symbolic-
  regression cloud-cover equation, ported 1:1 from GenesisAeon's TheorieArbeit
  Wolken-Modul.md and its verified DYAMOND coefficients (R^2 = 0.94, 11
  trainable parameters). Implements all three additive terms (I1, I2, I3)
  plus the paper's physical constraints (PC1-PC3), explicitly labelled as a
  diagnostic closure, not a forecast.
version: "0.4.0"
date-released: "2026-09-04"
license: MIT
